Z||000000||Darren's 87 coupe||11-23-2001||01:10 AM||||I know on a Fiero the 2m4 means 2 seat mid engine 4 cyl, but i pulled up on a Toyota mr2 today and couldn't think what it stands for?mid engine ?(r)?  2 seater?  any ideas?  just made me wonder.  I would never get one or want one.  is there engine a mid mount?  can't remember, but I think it was.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/blueman_copy_6.jpg"> ||||reg||1
