Z||000005||TRiAD||11-23-2001||11:35 AM||||The original "MR2" was the prototype, and it was "Mid-engine" "Rear drive" "2 seater". <P>Now, in some markets (Europe and Japan?) they have modified the meaning, while retaining the nomenclature, to the "Mid engine runabout 2 seater" name. <P>In the US, it's still plain old Mid engine Rear drive 2 seater.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0RAAAAN8VWdTblRDE93zkbJ*AbWuOFSwE0rtNS2h23KCe3aGgj1O!JDqud!IoFt1NPvdq6rh9ef*226xJh!nSf*vv2Id5gL8WoDCkDX*tCeM/1985-Signature-2.gif">     <BR><B><I><FONT COLOR="blue">Project MR1 ~ triadtuning@hotmail.com</B> ~ Photoshop rendition of planned modifications</I></FONT><p>[This message has been edited by TRiAD (edited 11-23-2001).]||||reg||1
