Z||000008||WKDFIRO||11-23-2001||02:56 PM||||When the current MR-2's prototypes were sighted in Japan the name had been the MR-J standing for Midship Runabout Joyful...<P>I guess they were translating it literally or something.<P>I have sat in the new MR-2 and it did feel very go-cart like visually. But it wasn't enough to keep me from smiling when I saw my 85 GT in the parking lot!||||reg||6
